ApiMethod(name="compile", params="source: string, options?: CompileOptions", returnType="string", desc="Compiles a Zolto source document into clean, accessible HTML output.")

@tabs {
  @tab JavaScript / TypeScript
```typescript
import { compile } from 'zolto';

const html = compile('@form login { @text username }');
```
  @tab Node.js CLI
```bash
npx zolto compile document.zl -o output.html
```
@/tabs

ApiMethod(name="parseInteractive", params="source: string", returnType="ParseResult", desc="Parses raw interactive block content into structured Phase 10 AST nodes with diagnostics.")

fill
**Parameters:**
- `source` (string) — Raw Zolto interactive content string.

**Returns:** `{ nodes: ASTNode[], diagnostics: InteractiveDiagnostics }`
end

